      "writtenOn": "2017-03-23T23:29:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is the following scenario possible? WSM enters ConnectMode which setWifiEnable(true). Then for some reason we run into some issue and don\u0027t invoke ConnectMode.exit()? This will leave mWifiEnabled\u003dmWifiConnectivityManagerEnabled\u003dtrue. Then later WSM tries to start over again and calls setWifiEnabled(true). Now because WCM thinks it is already enabled, so it won\u0027t clear blacklist and start a scan immediately.",
      "parentUuid": "837a2eec_5bb08c38",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1258,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 1258,
        "endChar": 30
