      "message": "Also, I think it is good to always wipe out the previous state when setWifiEnabled(true) is invoked by ConnectMode.enter(). So we always have a clean start. We don\u0027t really care about the previous state at this point. This is similar to we always call WifiNative.removeAllNetworks() in ConnectMode.enter().",
      "parentUuid": "78e5caf1_e9efd777",
