      "writtenOn": "2017-03-24T03:41:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t that the purpose here is to wipe out the blacklist when we enter ConnectMode() so we have a clean start? No matter it is two enables or just one, right? Otherwise, we even don\u0027t need to clear the blacklist at all. \n\nAgain, later we will add some logic to make sure the BSSIDs blacklisted because AP had no capacity won\u0027t be cleared.",
